cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If this repo helped you diagnose a local-LLM VRAM/scheduling problem, feel free to cite it."
title: "vram-thrash-diaries"
abstract: >-
  A field journal from a real debugging session on a dual-GPU local-LLM box
  running Hermes Agent on Ollama, diagnosing and fixing model-loading
  eviction thrashing, with 50 diagrams (Mermaid + dark/neon Graphviz) and a
  companion writeup on a separate Hermes Agent /goal outage.
authors:
  - name: "danindiana"
repository-code: "https://github.com/danindiana/vram-thrash-diaries"
url: "https://github.com/danindiana/vram-thrash-diaries"
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-09-15"
keywords:
  - ollama
  - llm
  - gpu
  - vram
  - local-llm
  - hermes-agent
  - debugging
